  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is linear differential equation of the form&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">P</mo><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">dx</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>sec</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mo></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>And, the solution is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>.</mo></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>sec</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mi>sec</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p>Now, at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced><mi>sec</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>&#960;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p>",
